From: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>
Subject: [PATCH] config.sub: recognize c33

c33, the Seiko Epson S1C33 family, passed only through the Cray
machines' c[123]* glob.  List it beside c30.

Signed-off-by: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>

diff --git a/config.sub b/config.sub
index 38f3d03..666f4be 100755
--- a/config.sub
+++ b/config.sub
@@ -1189,7 +1189,7 @@ case $cpu-$vendor in
 			| ba \
 			| be32 | be64 \
 			| bfin | bpf | bs2000 \
-			| c[123]* | c30 | [cjt]90 | c4x \
+			| c[123]* | c30 | c33 | [cjt]90 | c4x \
 			| c8051 | clipper | craynv | csky | cydra \
 			| d10v | d30v | dlx | dsp16xx \
 			| e2k | elxsi | epiphany \
